tapped.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"annotation"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is called when the user taps on the body of the callout view, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opposed to the callout’s left or right accessory view. If the annotation has a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom callout view via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:"},{"type":"text","text":" method, this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method is only called whenever the callout view calls its delegate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCalloutViewDelegate\/calloutViewTapped:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this method is present on the delegate, the standard callout view’s body"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"momentarily highlights when the user taps it, whether or not this method does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything in response to the tap."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Related-examples","text":"Related examples","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts, learn how to trigger an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action when an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":"s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" is tapped."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tells the delegate that the user tapped on an annotation’s callout view."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:tapOnCalloutForAnnotation:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:tapOnCalloutForAnnotation:":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:tapOnCalloutForAnnotation:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tells the delegate that the user tapped on an annotation’s callout view."}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:tapOnCalloutForAnnotation:"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:taponcalloutforannotation:","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"mapView:tapOnCalloutForAnnotation:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}],"title":"MLNMapView","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNCalloutViewDelegate/calloutViewTapped:":{"title":"calloutViewTapped:","abstract":[{"text":"Tells the delegate that the callout view has been tapped.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"calloutViewTapped:"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncalloutviewdelegate\/calloutviewtapped:","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCalloutViewDelegate\/calloutViewTapped:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotation"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}],"title":"MLNAnnotation"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapViewDelegate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"require the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"type":"text","text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"individual annotations."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapViewDelegate"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}